cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this handbook, please cite it as below."
title: "Post-Quantum Cryptography Developer's Handbook"
abstract: >-
  A learning notebook and reference for C/C++ developers covering FIPS 203
  (ML-KEM), FIPS 204 (ML-DSA), FIPS 205 (SLH-DSA), draft FIPS 206 (FN-DSA),
  hybrid cryptography, protocol integration, and migration of legacy
  codebases to post-quantum cryptography. Eleven modules, ~226 exercises,
  with runnable C reference programs.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Felicio
    given-names: Nuno
    email: nuno.felicio@gmail.com
version: "10.1"
date-released: "2026-04-25"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/kernelgurumeditation/pqc-gentle-chaos"
url: "https://github.com/kernelgurumeditation/pqc-gentle-chaos"
keywords:
  - post-quantum cryptography
  - ML-KEM
  - ML-DSA
  - SLH-DSA
  - FIPS 203
  - FIPS 204
  - FIPS 205
  - lattice cryptography
  - hybrid cryptography
  - cryptographic migration
  - reference book
